{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14114160","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14114160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1411415001:":{"text":"你们都没事吧？","source_cn":"你们都没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA40B9C00AA335B37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1411416001:0":{"text":"不、不好了——不对，太好了！幸好你在这里，祖娅！","source_cn":"不、不好了——不对，太好了！幸好你在这里，祖娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C4329E7A60CC7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1411416002:0":{"text":"下头矿区来了个尖耳朵小丫头，突然就开始到处乱炸！","source_cn":"下头矿区来了个尖耳朵小丫头，突然就开始到处乱炸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AD64E503CA2869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1411416003:1":{"text":"怎么回事？下面矿区出事了？有人在搞破坏？","source_cn":"怎么回事？下面矿区出事了？有人在搞破坏？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDE396F31E88FF86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1411416004:0":{"text":"也不是搞破坏，一开始她还好好的，突然就开始扔炸弹。","source_cn":"也不是搞破坏，一开始她还好好的，突然就开始扔炸弹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA762492431DCB7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1411416005:0":{"text":"刚刚你们听见轰隆隆的声音了吗？就是她干的。","source_cn":"刚刚你们听见轰隆隆的声音了吗？就是她干的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F56604E1378364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1411416006:2":{"text":"……突然扔炸弹的小丫头……","source_cn":"……突然扔炸弹的小丫头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49316B4F903E41A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1411416007:0":{"text":"二位，你们说的那个小姑娘，她长什么样子？是怎样的炸弹？你们起冲突了吗？","source_cn":"二位，你们说的那个小姑娘，她长什么样子？是怎样的炸弹？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C36C2D12CA6B685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1411416008:0":{"text":"呃，你这么问我们也搞不清楚，就是你们长身人的那样子。","source_cn":"呃，你这么问我们也搞不清楚，就是你们长身人的那样子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD7BC9679CCEDCCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1411416009:0":{"text":"我觉得和那帮尖耳朵挺像的，有鼻子有眼睛，个子高高耳朵尖尖的……","source_cn":"我觉得和那帮尖耳朵挺像的，有鼻子有眼睛，个子高高耳朵尖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14FB4654F72C8C69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1411416010:0":{"text":"具体鼻子眼睛怎么摆的，我们也看不清楚啊。","source_cn":"具体鼻子眼睛怎么摆的，我们也看不清楚啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A5BECE0C83A94DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1411416011:0":{"text":"而且也没冲突，就是不知道谁说了两句，她突然就生气了。","source_cn":"而且也没冲突，就是不知道谁说了两句，她突然就生气了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2645C3C24E74C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1411416012:0":{"text":"炸弹，就是黑黑的，圆圆的——对了，她还跟她的炸弹说话呢！","source_cn":"炸弹，就是黑黑的，圆圆的——对了，她还跟她的炸弹说话呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BDEEEBE08F89BC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1411416013:1":{"text":"大部分矮人都分不清长身人的模样，所以也通常没什么戒心。","source_cn":"大部分矮人都分不清长身人的模样，所以也通常没什么戒心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE69BC935B5A8332D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1411416014:1":{"text":"长相就姑且当做是少女的样子，但是突然生气，扔炸弹，和炸弹说话……","source_cn":"长相就姑且当做是少女的样子，但是突然生气，扔炸弹，和炸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3545044A6C452ACE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1411416015:0":{"text":"祖娅，事情很可能比预想得更严重，我们赶紧下去。","source_cn":"祖娅，事情很可能比预想得更严重，我们赶紧下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60D11DD98465042A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1411416016:0":{"text":"好，你们两个也跟我来，一起组织下面停工。","source_cn":"好，你们两个也跟我来，一起组织下面停工。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E01479B5B9AE6F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1411416017:1":{"text":"咦，对了，你们刚刚上来没看到她吗？她刚才从这边离开的。","source_cn":"咦，对了，你们刚刚上来没看到她吗？她刚才从这边离开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D6905C978A2E716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1411416018:1":{"text":"没有，但我倒是听见轰隆一声。","source_cn":"没有，但我倒是听见轰隆一声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A265D4A7C2CAAE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1411416019:1":{"text":"她很会用炸弹，估计刚刚又打通了新通道吧。","source_cn":"她很会用炸弹，估计刚刚又打通了新通道吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x218CC3080448D3A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1411416020:1":{"text":"在这地下随便动用炸弹，还自己开了新通道……这小姑娘是什么人啊，巴赫朗？","source_cn":"在这地下随便动用炸弹，还自己开了新通道……这小姑娘是什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE0822AAE4B3339B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1411416021:1":{"text":"现在还不好说，但我希望不是我认识的那位。","source_cn":"现在还不好说，但我希望不是我认识的那位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E982B72CB88CB90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1411416022:1":{"text":"快点走吧，免得再耽搁一会儿，她又做出什么事来。","source_cn":"快点走吧，免得再耽搁一会儿，她又做出什么事来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x251541CBFA5880DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:14014023:0":{"text":"地震再次爆发！两个矿工慌慌张张地跑来找祖娅。","source_cn":"地震再次爆发！两个矿工慌慌张张地跑来找祖娅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA217AE9151B4750E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"祖娅","source":"祖娅","status":"source"},"speaker:矿区负责人":{"text":"矿区负责人","source":"矿区负责人","status":"source"},"speaker:负责人助手":{"text":"负责人助手","source":"负责人助手","status":"source"},"speaker:巴赫朗":{"text":"巴赫朗","source":"巴赫朗","status":"source"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黑屏字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":5}}